**Smart Shield Note:** Argo Smart Routing is evolving into Smart Shield; best practices remain applicable. Monitor Cloudflare changelog.

- **Always check editability** before attempting to enable/disable Argo.
- **Set up billing notifications** to avoid unexpected costs.
- **Combine with Tiered Cache** for maximum performance.
- **Use in production only**; disable for dev/staging.
- **Monitor analytics**; require 500+ requests in 48h for detailed metrics.
- **Handle errors gracefully**: billing, permissions, and zone compatibility.
- **Test configuration changes** in staging before production.
- **Use TypeScript SDK** and **Implement retry logic** for production API calls.
- **Document zone-specific settings**.

Unavailable-zone error: verify Enterprise+ plan, Account → Billing configuration, valid payment method; contact Cloudflare support if unclear.

Unchanged status or `editable: false`: check token `Zone:Argo Smart Routing:Edit`; **Verify `editable: true` in GET response before attempting PATCH**. If false, check billing, Enterprise+ plan, holds/suspensions, and token scopes.

```ts
const status = await client.argo.smartRouting.get({ zone_id: zoneId });
if (!status.editable) {
  // Don't attempt to modify - will fail
  console.error("Cannot modify Argo settings:");
  console.error("- Check billing is configured");
  console.error("- Verify zone has Enterprise+ plan");
  console.error("- Confirm API token has Edit permission");
  throw new Error("Argo is not editable for this zone");
}
// Safe to proceed with enable/disable
await client.argo.smartRouting.edit({ zone_id: zoneId, value: "on" });
```

429: typically 1200 requests/5 minutes. Use `RateLimitError`, `retry-after`, and exponential backoff.

Limits: analytics 500/48h; Enterprise+; billing required; 1200 req/5 min/token; Spectrum no hard limit; proxied traffic only; DDoS/WAF-mitigated traffic excluded; analytics latency 1–5 minutes.

Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com
